{"id":61,"date":"2019-10-27T03:27:18","date_gmt":"2019-10-27T03:27:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/latentfaces.feymore.com\/?page_id=61"},"modified":"2022-08-15T05:15:41","modified_gmt":"2022-08-15T04:15:41","slug":"news","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/news","title":{"rendered":"News"},"content":{"rendered":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<\/p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1785\" src=\"https:\/\/latentfaces.feymore.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/589258-300x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"188\" srcset=\"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/589258-300x188.jpg 300w, http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/589258-600x375.jpg 600w, http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/589258-768x480.jpg 768w, http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/589258-1024x640.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/589258.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n\n\n<p style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-larger-font-size has-black-color wp-block-paragraph\">Releases<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"background-color:#eeff5b;color:#101010\" class=\"has-text-color has-background wp-block-paragraph\">Rahi is available at reverbnation, twitter and facebook. He released an instrumental album from the label at www.dugdugi.com . Released nine albums till now.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-larger-font-size has-black-color wp-block-paragraph\">Recent Updates<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-black-color wp-block-paragraph\">We mostly do studio work, instead of a lot of gigs. looking forward to do more as we did earlier.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-larger-font-size has-black-color wp-block-paragraph\">Influences<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-black-color wp-block-paragraph\">Joe Satriani, Dream Theatre, Marty Friedman, Pink Floyd etc. Basically a guitarplayer. Also play bass, keys, some eastern instruments.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-larger-font-size has-black-color wp-block-paragraph\">Bio<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-black-color wp-block-paragraph\">I have been playing guitar my whole life and have learned many things from many people. My training began when I was 16 years old in 2000 A.D. After some time from some famous guitarists. I play bass, electronic keyboards, guitars currently. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m pursuing my dream in this profession and have already written many songs and books.. I am currently working with my main band \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Advent Flair.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d. We didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t do a lot of gigs rather worked in the studio.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Releases Rahi is available at reverbnation, twitter and facebook. He released an instrumental album from the label at www.dugdugi.com . Released nine albums till now.&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"ngg_post_thumbnail":0,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-61","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/61","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=61"}],"version-history":[{"count":14,"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/61\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3411,"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/61\/revisions\/3411"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=61"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}